%% Sequence: Prompt Interceptor Flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Writer
    participant FE as React + Tiptap
    participant GW as FastAPI Gateway
    participant INT as Interceptor Engine
    participant AI as AIService (Gemini)
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant MR as Margin Repository

    U->>FE: Types prompt:<br/>"write a paragraph about X"
    FE->>FE: Detect delegative pattern<br/>(regex + heuristics)
    FE->>GW: POST /interceptor<br/>{paragraph_context, prompt_text}
    GW->>GW: Validate JWT + rate limit
    GW->>INT: classify_prompt()
    INT->>AI: classify via Gemini<br/>(behavior tag classifier)
    AI-->>INT: {tag: "delegative",<br/>confidence: 0.92}
    INT->>AI: generate_socratic_reframing<br/>(prompt template: [Spark Gap])
    AI-->>INT: "What claim must your<br/>reader accept first?"
    INT->>MR: persist intervention<br/>(type=interceptor, status=active)
    MR->>DB: INSERT intervention
    INT-->>GW: {action: "reframe",<br/>socratic_question, intervention_id}
    GW-->>FE: 200 OK + intervention payload
    FE->>FE: Render ghost question in<br/>Living Margin (NOT in body)
    FE-->>U: Margin displays:<br/>"What claim must your<br/>reader accept first?"
    U->>FE: Writer types their own answer<br/>(original prose preserved)
